{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"嗚呼，堯、舜盛矣！三代之王，功有餘而德不足，故皆更始以自新，由是改正朔矣，至於後世，遂名年以建元。及僭竊交興，而稱號紛雜，則不可以不別也。五代十國，稱帝改元者七。吳越、荊、楚，常行中國年號。然予聞於故老，謂吳越亦甞稱帝改元，而求其事跡不可得，頗疑吳越後自諱之。及旁采閩、楚、南漢諸國之書，與吳越往來者多矣，皆無稱帝之事。獨得其封落星石為寶石山制書，稱寶正六年辛卯，則知其甞改元矣。辛卯，長興二年，乃鏐之末世也，然不見其終始所因，故不得而備列。錢氏訖五代，甞外尊中國，豈其張軌之比乎。十國皆非中國有也，其稱帝改元與不，未足較其得失，故並列之。作十國世家年譜。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"南漢","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"吳越","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"南平","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"丁卯","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"梁太祖","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"開平元年","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"李克用","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"天祐四年","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"楊渥","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"天祐四年","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"王建","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"天復七年","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"是歲，即位。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_ngu_dai_71_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_ngu_dai_71","textTraditional":"劉隱","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_n